(PUPI - YOUR LITTLE AI PET COMPANION) '
(Virtual Pet AI Challenge - Final Master Development & Submission Document) '
() '
(1. PRODUCT IDENTITY & CORE ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLE) '
(Product: PUPI - Your Little AI Pet Companion) '
(Platform: Android smartphones only.) '
(Core concept: A small interactive 3D puppy that floats above supported Android applications.) '
(Pupi lives natively on the screen during everyday smartphone use.) '
() '
(STRICT PRODUCT DECISION:) '
(- There is NO dedicated Pupi pet-care application experience.) '
(- No separate pet-care app or pet home screen.) '
(- The floating 3D puppy is the entire product experience.) '
(- Minimal Android host interface is permitted solely as an onboarding gate for SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW) '
(  permission, battery optimization whitelisting, and microphone access.) '
() '
(2. RECOMMENDED ANDROID TECHNOLOGY \\\(Optimized for Intel i3-1215U / 8GB RAM\\\)) '
(3D Rendering Engine: Google Filament \\\(PBR\\\)) '
(Justification:) '
(- Lightweight C++ core with Android Kotlin bindings \\\(only ~6MB native libs\\\).) '
(- Compiles rapidly without the 4GB+ RAM penalty and slow editor launches of Unity.) '
(- Provides Physically Based Rendering \\\(PBR\\\), transparent TextureView overlays, and skeletal animation.) '
(- Dynamic frame throttling: 0 FPS when stationary idle, 60 FPS during touch and movement.) '
(Window Overlay: Android WindowManager \\\(TYPE_APPLICATION_OVERLAY\\\) bound to a Foreground Service.) '
(State & Persistence: Room Database \\\(SQLite + Flow\\\) for offline-first reactive persistence.) '
(Voice & Audio: Native Android SpeechRecognizer and TextToSpeech \\\(zero cloud dependencies\\\).) '
() '
(3. CHARACTER DESIGN - PUPI) '
(Visual Appearance:) '
(- Soft white body with warm caramel-brown patches over the left eye and lower back.) '
(- Large expressive warm amber/brown eyes with procedural specular highlight.) '
(- Floppy brown ears with natural secondary physics bounce.) '
(- Small velvety puppy nose and rounded snout with a gentle smile crease.) '
(- Bright red nylon collar with a yellow brass tag engraved with PUPI.) '
(- Proportions: 4,800 polygons, 32 bones, optimized for smooth 60 FPS mobile rendering.) '
(Personality: Curious, playful, mischievous, innocent, friendly, observant, kind-hearted.) '
() '
(4. TASK 1 - THE STORY OF PUPI: A HEARTBEAT ON THE GLASS) '
(The first time Julian saw Pupi, it was 11:42 PM on a Thursday. Julian's phone screen was) '
(buried beneath a spread of half-read PDF lecture notes and a cold cup of tea. He clicked) '
(the power button, bracing for the usual flood of stressful group-chat pings and deadlines.) '
() '
(Instead, the screen lit up with a tiny soft white puppy sitting quietly just above his dock icons.) '
(Pupi had floppy caramel-brown ears, a bright red collar, and a yellow medallion that glinted) '
(softly as he lifted his head. When Julian stared in surprise, Pupi blinked twice, tilted his head) '
(with an inquisitive soft sound, and took three hesitant steps before rolling onto his belly.) '
() '
(Julian reached out and tapped the puppy's head. Pupi sprang up, eyes sparkling, tail wagging) '
ET

endstream
endobj
